// Compile Error: a block comment that never closes
//
// Block comments nest, so the inner `/*` needs a `*/` of its own and the one
// at the end of the line closes only that. The rest of the file is comment,
// which used to surface as a missing `}` at the end of the file.

func main() {
    // ERROR: the outer comment is still open at the end of the file [E0006]
    /* outer /* inner */
    println("hi")
}
